<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">WatchHAR: Real-time On-device Human Activity Recognition System for Smartwatches</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_conference"><span class="ltx_note_name">Conference: </span>Proceedings of the 27th International Conference on Multimodal Interaction; October 13–17, 2025; Canberra, ACT, Australia</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_booktitle">Proceedings of the 27th International Conference on Multimodal Interaction (ICMI ’25), October 13–17, 2025, Canberra, ACT, Australia</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_doi"><span class="ltx_note_name">DOI: </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1145/3716553.3750775">10.1145/3716553.3750775</a></span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_isbn"><span class="ltx_note_name">ISBN: </span>979-8-4007-1499-3/2025/10</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Human-centered computing Ubiquitous and mobile computing systems and tools</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Applied computing Health informatics</span></span></span>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author"><span class="ltx_annotated_personname">
